cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pefftacular in your research, please cite the software using these metadata."
type: software
title: "pefftacular: Reading and writing PSI Extended FASTA files in Python"
abstract: >-
  A pure-Python library for reading and writing PSI Extended FASTA Format
  (PEFF) files, including rich per-entry proteomics annotations for
  modifications, variants, processed forms, proteoforms, and disulfide bonds.
authors:
  - given-names: Patrick T.
    family-names: Garrett
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8434-9693
    affiliation: Scripps Research Institute
repository-code: https://github.com/tacular-omics/pefftacular
url: https://pypi.org/project/pefftacular/
license: MIT
version: 0.4.0
keywords:
  - Python
  - Proteomics
  - Mass Spectrometry
  - PEFF
  - FASTA
  - Bioinformatics
